,"roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:150452","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"アトリエ ピーチ","creatorId":"vndb:s5430","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5430","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5430","name":"アトリエ ピーチ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:150453","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"こおろぎ アトリエ","creatorId":"vndb:s12393","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12393","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12393","name":"こおろぎ アトリエ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:150455","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c62604","characterName":"レイナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56222","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16811"],"vndbCharacterId":"c62604"},"originalCharacterName":"レイナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Works at a bathhouse (brothel). Whether it is her personalty or experience, she the ideal woman that is both friendly and beautiful, and seemingly understanding of her customers' needs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is in love with one of her customers and wants to get married to them. Her boyfriend said if she got pregnant he would marry her and she would be able to leave the prostitution business. Promising him she wouldn't let anyone come inside her, she would claim the kid as his."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62604"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本番のない風俗ヘルス嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代に大恋愛の末捨てられた辛い経験から、一転風俗に身を落としているが、性格は明るく人懐っこく可愛らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もともと優しすぎる人柄であったのが、失恋以降、人を好きになる事に臆病になってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな人間性が、風俗に身を置いていても表に出るので、彼女を本気で口説く客は大変多く、中には風俗を辞めて子供作って結婚しようと言ってくる客もいたりして、その客が今回の相談の種である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎回、禁止されているSEXを許してしまい、しかも避妊もせずに中出し三昧をさせている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女自身もかなり本気なのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むろん、サービス内容にSEXは含まれてはいないので、店にしれたらアウト!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その男とのみ極秘に本番をしているのだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本当に子供が出来たら、彼の言うとおり結婚してもいかな……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"と考えているが、なかなか妊娠しないので主人公の子種サービスを利用することにした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16811","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本番なしの風俗ヘルス嬢。 大恋愛の末に捨てられた経験から風俗に身を落とした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は優しく明るく人懐っこいが、失恋以降は恋愛に臆病になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在本気で結婚を迫っている客がおり、まんざらでもなく毎回本番を許している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供ができたら結婚してもいいかなと思っているが、なかなか妊娠しないため……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56222"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8e05f47aa91c4c5f97532c9857d7635045746b5b5432b9e95a1f1c6c1707401.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cd813f277867a2ea9d4a5656844f61a2cd70d9a97662ad86302dd6189370a5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c63210","characterName":"法条 夏子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56223","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"},{"characterId":"56223","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"249812"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16812"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63210"},"originalCharacterName":"法条 夏子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A married woman who is working at the protagonist's office. She usually harshly criticizes his modus operandi. She wants a child but her husband does not, so she hasn't had sex for a while."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Secretly fell in love the protagonist. Tooya has an inkling of Nastuko's feelings but never made a move because of fear of losing her -- his important employee. While she initially loved her husband, their relationship changed after marriage. Her husband kept trying to escalate their sexual acts but Natsuko refused. Since then, he became colder towards her and distanced himself from her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63210"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事務所で働く人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のビジネスである妊娠願望のある女性を調達してくる名人、敏腕スタッフである"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、会社の経営にもチョイチョイ口を出し、主人公のやり口を辛辣にののしる辛口コメントの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の家庭は上手く行っていると強がるが、実は子供が欲しいらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら旦那が子供拒否で、やりたいだけの男だったので、現在はセックスレスのようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"25239","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一ノ渡事務所で働く敏腕スタッフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前作から２年、今年からは遠哉が連れてきた冴城と一緒に事務所を切り盛りすることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常時事務所を留守となり、あろうことか元カノの伊織のもとに駆け込んだ遠哉に苛立ちが隠せない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在家庭の方はヤリたがりの夫とのレスが深刻化し、別居するにまで至っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その日々の苛立ちを迫ってくる冴城にもてはやされることで緩和しているが、実は冴城も面倒なことばかり起こす男だと知って最近は辟易。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結局はダメンズに振り回される人生のようだ。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の事務所で働く人妻。 妊娠願望のある女性を調達してくる名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同時に、会社の経営にも口出しして主人公のやり口を辛辣に罵る辛口の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の家庭は上手くいっていると強がるが、実は子供が欲しいらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旦那はヤりたいだけの子供拒否で、現在はセックスレスになっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56223"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"30 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16812","sourceWorkId":"26911","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/dedd44f63218acc2acae7fe9b0b789b4dda238fb05ae80a7e8216d2371aa2ea2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f619cf94d6df365ffc429c0ade0af708298c6300c4f7ea0627493b4e3fa0b2be.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なつめ美南海","creatorId":"vndb:s5844","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5844","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5844","name":"なつめ 美南海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:249812:56223:25459:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63211","characterName":"下古立 伊織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56224","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213718"